  "claim": "For two primary-source verifier failures, the vulnerable upstream x86 parent executes the unsafe direct map access, the official fix rejects the same canonical BPF input, broad Morello authority executes it, and exact map-value authority raises a Morello capability-bounds fault at the intended JIT instruction. For CVE-2021-3490, a protected adjacent map value is changed only by the vulnerable x86 and broad-authority executions and remains byte-for-byte unchanged after fixed-verifier and exact-authority runs.",
